      {
         "id": "SECTION_conclusion",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Conclusion</h3>We learned about the Hindu-Arabic numbers and how they connect with our fingers. There are many other number systems and many things we can do with numbers. But before we go on, on the next page we will review what we learned with some fun activities.</p>",
